# =============================================================================
#  JalRakshak — root .gitignore
# =============================================================================

# ---- SECRETS — kabhi commit nahi -------------------------------------------
# _secrets/firebase-admin.json ek SERVICE ACCOUNT PRIVATE KEY hai. Ye leak hua to
# koi bhi hamare Firebase project pe push notification bhej sakta hai (aur baaki
# Firebase resources chhoo sakta hai). GitHub pe chala gaya to key turant revoke
# karni padegi — Firebase Console > Project settings > Service accounts.
#
# google-services.json utna khatarnak nahi (wo waise bhi APK ke andar ship hota hai),
# par project config hai, isliye repo se bahar hi rakhte hain.
#
# SETUP.md step 5 mein `git add .` likha hai — is line ke bina wo poori _secrets/
# folder stage kar deta. Isiliye ye sabse upar hai.
_secrets/
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
firebase-admin.json
google-services.json
.env
.env.local

# ---- INTERNAL / LOCAL-ONLY — GitHub pe kabhi nahi ---------------------------
# Ye files team ke andar ke kaam ki hain: planning, AI ka context, aur wo notes
# jinme saaf likha hai ki kaunsa seed data representative hai. Public repo mein
# inka koi kaam nahi. Local machine pe rehti hain, bas push nahi hotin.
#
# NOTE: README.md JAAN-BUJH KE track ho raha hai — wahi ek file hai jo naye
# developer ko repo samajhne ke liye chahiye. SETUP.md local-only hai kyunki
# README already setup steps cover karta hai.

# Claude Code / AI ka context
CLAUDE.md
docs/ai-context.md
docs/decisions.md

# Internal setup notes (README mein setup already hai)
SETUP.md

# Planning aur prompts
BUILD_PLAN.md
DIN1_PROMPT.md
DIN*_PROMPT.md

# Design reference (approved mockup — internal)
mockup*.html

# Data honesty notes (kya real hai, kya representative)
data/DATA_NOTES.md

# ---- Dependencies (har sub-project ka apna .gitignore bhi hai, ye safety net hai) --
node_modules/
vendor/
dist/

# ---- OS / editor -----------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
